The Netgear D7800 is a ADSL/VDSL modem plus router. It is very similar to the Netgear R7500v2 besides including a modem. Based on the IPQ8064 Dual Core SoC clocked at 1.4Ghz. DSL modem is a VRX320. Uses the QCA9982 for 5Ghz WiFi and the QCA9980 for 2.4Ghz WiFi.

<color #ed1c24>**Important:**</color>  The DSL modem within the D7800 is NOT supported by OpenWrt.

